    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know they love me, but that just makes it worse. i see them looking at me with so much pride and it feels like a lie. i feel like i'm living a life that doesn't belong to me anymore, just a performance of being the \"perfect kid\" while everything inside is falling apart. i just want the performance to end. i want to stop being a burden to them and just... stop. i feel like if i keep going, i'm just going to keep disappointing them over and over again until there's nothing left.",
